# Error Catastrophe Simulation

This repository implements a set of dynamical models illustrating
informational separability, recoverability, and collapse (error catastrophe)
across multiple systems:

- Logistic map separability
- Gray–Scott reaction–diffusion model
- Failure propagation dynamics

All figures are generated automatically and saved to the `figures/` directory.

---

## 🚀 Running in Google Colab (recommended)

1. Open a new Colab notebook.
2. Run:

```python
